<title>FRANCE: Rouen February flour exports down yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Rouen February flour exports down yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Flour exports from the French port of Rouen declined to 36,996 tonnes in February 1997 from 67,000 tonnes in February 1996, port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>February exports included 21,774 tonnes for Yemen, 10,122 tonnes for Libya and 5,100 tonnes for West Africa.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
